<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Gift 17 · The Zeel Archive</title>

<style>

*{
  box-sizing:border-box;
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
}

:root{
  --paper:#eee3d0;
  --paper-light:#f8f0e2;
  --paper-white:#fffaf0;
  --ink:#302923;
  --brown:#59483c;
  --brown-light:#806c5b;
  --coffee:#3f3027;
  --gold:#a9854c;
  --gold-light:#d0b57b;
  --line:#d5c5ae;
  --muted:#8c7968;
  --red:#8c574d;
}

html,
body{
  min-height:100%;
}

body{
  font-family:
    Inter,
    ui-sans-serif,
    system-ui,
    -apple-system,
    BlinkMacSystemFont,
    "Segoe UI",
    sans-serif;

  color:var(--ink);

  background:
    radial-gradient(
      circle at 15% 10%,
      rgba(192,157,106,.17),
      transparent 28%
    ),
    radial-gradient(
      circle at 85% 80%,
      rgba(110,82,58,.10),
      transparent 30%
    ),
    linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      #e9ddca,
      #f8f0e2 48%,
      #e8dac5
    );

  overflow-x:hidden;
}

body:before{
  content:"";
  position:fixed;
  inset:0;
  pointer-events:none;
  z-index:0;

  opacity:.18;

  background-image:
    repeating-linear-gradient(
      0deg,
      rgba(40,30,20,.035) 0px,
      rgba(40,30,20,.035) 1px,
      transparent 1px,
      transparent 4px
    );
}

button{
  font:inherit;
}


/* =========================================================
   AMBIENT BACKGROUND
========================================================= */

.background{
  position:fixed;
  inset:0;
  pointer-events:none;
  overflow:hidden;
  z-index:0;
}

.dust{
  position:absolute;

  width:3px;
  height:3px;

  border-radius:50%;

  background:#9c7b56;

  opacity:.18;

  animation:
    dustMove linear infinite;
}

@keyframes dustMove{

  from{
    transform:
      translateY(110vh)
      translateX(0);
  }

  to{
    transform:
      translateY(-10vh)
      translateX(35px);
  }

}

.circle{
  position:absolute;

  border:1px solid rgba(137,102,65,.14);

  border-radius:50%;
}

.circle.one{
  width:500px;
  height:500px;

  right:-250px;
  top:-180px;
}

.circle.two{
  width:350px;
  height:350px;

  left:-180px;
  bottom:-160px;
}


/* =========================================================
   MAIN
========================================================= */

.app{
  position:relative;
  z-index:2;

  width:min(1000px,calc(100% - 26px));

  margin:auto;

  padding:
    28px
    0
    60px;
}


/* =========================================================
   HEADER
========================================================= */

.header{
  display:flex;

  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:flex-start;

  gap:25px;

  border-bottom:
    1px solid
    var(--line);

  padding-bottom:17px;
}

.archive-id{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:11px;
}

.archive-dot{
  width:9px;
  height:9px;

  border-radius:50%;

  background:var(--gold);
}

.archive-label{
  font-size:10px;

  letter-spacing:3px;

  text-transform:uppercase;

  color:var(--brown-light);

  font-weight:800;
}

.archive-number{
  font-family:
    Georgia,
    "Times New Roman",
    serif;

  color:var(--brown-light);

  font-size:13px;
}


/* =========================================================
   INTRO
========================================================= */

.intro{
  padding:
    65px
    0
    35px;
}

.classification{
  display:inline-block;

  color:var(--red);

  border:
    1px solid
    rgba(140,87,77,.35);

  padding:
    5px
    9px;

  font-size:9px;

  letter-spacing:2px;

  text-transform:uppercase;

  margin-bottom:17px;

  transform:rotate(-1deg);
}

.intro h1{
  font-family:
    Georgia,
    "Times New Roman",
    serif;

  font-size:
    clamp(
      45px,
      8vw,
      82px
    );

  line-height:.93;

  letter-spacing:-4px;

  font-weight:500;

  color:var(--coffee);
}

.intro h1 span{
  color:var(--brown-light);
}

.intro p{
  max-width:650px;

  margin-top:23px;

  color:var(--muted);

  font-size:14px;

  line-height:1.85;
}


/* =========================================================
   ARCHIVE SHEET
========================================================= */

.archive{
  position:relative;

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(255,250,240,.96),
      rgba(245,236,221,.97)
    );

  border:
    1px solid
    var(--line);

  box-shadow:
    0 30px 90px rgba(60,43,31,.14),
    0 2px 8px rgba(60,43,31,.07);

  min-height:650px;

  overflow:hidden;
}

.archive:before{
  content:"";

  position:absolute;

  left:0;
  top:0;
  bottom:0;

  width:5px;

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      var(--gold),
      var(--gold-light),
      var(--gold)
    );
}


/* =========================================================
   TOP FILE BAR
========================================================= */

.filebar{
  display:flex;

  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;

  padding:
    17px
    23px;

  border-bottom:
    1px solid
    var(--line);

  background:
    rgba(238,227,208,.48);
}

.filebar-left{
  display:flex;

  align-items:center;

  gap:14px;
}

.file-code{
  color:var(--brown);

  font-size:10px;

  letter-spacing:2px;

  text-transform:uppercase;

  font-weight:800;
}

.file-status{
  color:#6d7259;

  font-size:9px;

  letter-spacing:1.5px;

  text-transform:uppercase;
}

.file-status:before{
  content:"";

  display:inline-block;

  width:6px;
  height:6px;

  margin-right:6px;

  border-radius:50%;

  background:#798363;
}


/* =========================================================
   PAGE
========================================================= */

.page{
  display:none;

  padding:
    clamp(27px,6vw,58px);

  min-height:560px;

  animation:
    pageIn .48s ease;
}

.page.active{
  display:block;
}

@keyframes pageIn{

  from{
    opacity:0;

    transform:
      translateX(20px);
  }

  to{
    opacity:1;

    transform:
      translateX(0);
  }

}


/* =========================================================
   PAGE HEADER
========================================================= */

.page-top{
  display:flex;

  justify-content:space-between;

  align-items:flex-start;

  gap:20px;

  margin-bottom:38px;
}

.page-number{
  font-family:
    Georgia,
    serif;

  color:var(--gold);

  font-size:14px;

  letter-spacing:2px;
}

.page-type{
  color:var(--muted);

  font-size:9px;

  letter-spacing:2px;

  text-transform:uppercase;

  text-align:right;
}


/* =========================================================
   PAGE CONTENT
========================================================= */

.page h2{
  max-width:800px;

  font-family:
    Georgia,
    "Times New Roman",
    serif;

  font-size:
    clamp(
      34px,
      6vw,
      58px
    );

  line-height:1.04;

  letter-spacing:-2px;

  font-weight:500;

  color:var(--coffee);

  margin-bottom:23px;
}

.page h2 span{
  color:var(--brown-light);
}

.page .lead{
  max-width:720px;

  font-family:
    Georgia,
    "Times New Roman",
    serif;

  font-size:
    clamp(
      18px,
      3vw,
      23px
    );

  line-height:1.65;

  color:var(--brown);

  margin-bottom:25px;
}

.page .body{
  max-width:720px;

  color:var(--muted);

  font-size:14px;

  line-height:1.9;
}


/* =========================================================
   SPECIAL QUOTE
========================================================= */

.quote{
  margin:
    35px
    0;

  padding:
    25px
    27px;

  border-left:
    3px solid
    var(--gold);

  background:
    rgba(220,204,178,.20);

  color:var(--brown);

  font-family:
    Georgia,
    serif;

  font-size:20px;

  line-height:1.65;
}


/* =========================================================
   TWO COLUMN INFORMATION
========================================================= */

.columns{
  display:grid;

  grid-template-columns:
    1fr 1fr;

  gap:18px;

  margin-top:30px;
}

.info{
  border:
    1px solid
    var(--line);

  padding:22px;

  background:
    rgba(255,250,240,.55);
}

.info-label{
  font-size:9px;

  letter-spacing:2px;

  text-transform:uppercase;

  color:var(--gold);

  font-weight:800;

  margin-bottom:10px;
}

.info-value{
  font-family:
    Georgia,
    serif;

  color:var(--brown);

  font-size:18px;

  line-height:1.5;
}


/* =========================================================
   ROUTINE
========================================================= */

.timeline{
  margin-top:30px;

  border-top:
    1px solid
    var(--line);
}

.timeline-item{
  display:grid;

  grid-template-columns:
    100px
    1fr;

  gap:20px;

  padding:
    17px
    0;

  border-bottom:
    1px solid
    rgba(213,197,174,.7);
}

.time{
  color:var(--gold);

  font-family:
    Georgia,
    serif;

  font-size:13px;
}

.activity{
  color:var(--brown);

  font-size:13px;

  line-height:1.6;
}


/* =========================================================
   METER
========================================================= */

.meter-block{
  margin-top:32px;
}

.meter-row{
  margin-bottom:21px;
}

.meter-label{
  display:flex;

  justify-content:space-between;

  color:var(--brown);

  font-size:12px;

  margin-bottom:7px;
}

.meter{
  height:7px;

  background:#e2d6c5;

  overflow:hidden;
}

.meter span{
  display:block;

  height:100%;

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      var(--gold),
      #c9a96f
    );

  transform-origin:left;

  animation:
    meterIn 1.1s ease;
}

@keyframes meterIn{

  from{
    transform:scaleX(0);
  }

  to{
    transform:scaleX(1);
  }

}


/* =========================================================
   STAMP
========================================================= */

.stamp{
  display:inline-block;

  border:
    2px solid
    var(--red);

  color:var(--red);

  padding:
    8px
    12px;

  font-size:9px;

  letter-spacing:2px;

  text-transform:uppercase;

  transform:rotate(-3deg);

  margin-top:27px;
}


/* =========================================================
   NAVIGATION
========================================================= */

.navigation{
  display:flex;

  justify-content:space-between;

  align-items:center;

  gap:15px;

  border-top:
    1px solid
    var(--line);

  padding:
    18px
    23px;

  background:
    rgba(238,227,208,.42);
}

.nav-btn{
  border:
    1px solid
    var(--line);

  background:
    rgba(255,250,240,.75);

  color:var(--brown);

  padding:
    10px
    17px;

  cursor:pointer;

  font-size:10px;

  letter-spacing:1.5px;

  text-transform:uppercase;

  font-weight:800;

  transition:.2s;
}

.nav-btn:hover{
  background:#fffaf0;

  border-color:var(--gold);

  transform:translateY(-1px);
}

.nav-btn:disabled{
  opacity:.3;

  cursor:not-allowed;

  transform:none;
}

.page-counter{
  color:var(--muted);

  font-family:
    Georgia,
    serif;

  font-size:13px;
}


/* =========================================================
   FINAL PAGE SPECIAL
========================================================= */

.final-page{
  text-align:center;
}

.final-page h2{
  max-width:none;
}

.final-page .body{
  margin:auto;
}

.final-symbol{
  width:90px;
  height:90px;

  margin:
    0
    auto
    30px;

  border:
    1px solid
    var(--gold);

  display:grid;

  place-items:center;

  font-family:
    Georgia,
    serif;

  font-size:25px;

  color:var(--gold);

  transform:rotate(45deg);
}

.final-symbol span{
  transform:rotate(-45deg);
}


/* =========================================================
   RESPONSIVE
========================================================= */

@media(max-width:680px){

  .app{
    width:
      calc(100% - 16px);

    padding-top:18px;
  }

  .intro{
    padding-top:43px;
  }

  .intro h1{
    letter-spacing:-2.3px;
  }

  .archive{
    min-height:0;
  }

  .page{
    padding:
      28px
      19px
      38px;
  }

  .page h2{
    letter-spacing:-1.2px;
  }

  .columns{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }

  .timeline-item{
    grid-template-columns:
      72px
      1fr;

    gap:13px;
  }

  .navigation{
    padding:
      15px;

    gap:8px;
  }

  .nav-btn{
    padding:
      9px
      11px;

    font-size:9px;
  }

  .filebar{
    padding:
      14px
      16px;
  }

}


/* =========================================================
   PAGE TURN FLASH
========================================================= */

.page-turn{
  position:fixed;

  inset:0;

  background:
    rgba(248,240,226,.72);

  z-index:30;

  pointer-events:none;

  opacity:0;

  transition:
    opacity .25s ease;
}

.page-turn.active{
  opacity:1;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="background">

  <div class="circle one"></div>
  <div class="circle two"></div>

</div>


<div class="page-turn" id="pageTurn"></div>


<div class="app">


  <!-- =========================================
       HEADER
  ========================================== -->

  <header class="header">

    <div class="archive-id">

      <div class="archive-dot"></div>

      <div class="archive-label">
        Personal Archive
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="archive-number">
      GIFT 17 / 18
    </div>

  </header>


  <!-- =========================================
       INTRO
  ========================================== -->

  <section class="intro">

    <div class="classification">
      PRIVATE · OPEN ONLY ONCE
    </div>

    <h1>
      The <span>Zeel</span><br>
      Archive.
    </h1>

    <p>
      Eighteen pages about the person behind the plans,
      the late nights, the random ideas, the dreams,
      the mistakes, the effort, and the ordinary days
      that nobody really sees.
    </p>

  </section>


  <!-- =========================================
       ARCHIVE
  ========================================== -->

  <main class="archive">


    <div class="filebar">

      <div class="filebar-left">

        <div class="file-code">
          Z · 2026 · PERSONAL
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="file-status">
        Open
      </div>

    </div>


    <!-- =========================================
         PAGE 01
    ========================================== -->

    <section class="page active">

      <div class="page-top">

        <div class="page-number">
          01
        </div>

        <div class="page-type">
          Beginning
        </div>

      </div>

      <h2>
        I am still <span>becoming.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="lead">
        I don't think I have become the person I want to be yet.
      </p>

      <p class="body">
        There are still so many things I want to learn,
        understand, build, experience, and improve.
        Sometimes I know exactly where I want to go.
        Sometimes I don't.
        But even when the direction becomes blurry,
        I keep trying to move forward.
      </p>

      <div class="quote">
        “I am not finished. I am just getting started.”
      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================================
         PAGE 02
    ========================================== -->

    <section class="page">

      <div class="page-top">
        <div class="page-number">02</div>
        <div class="page-type">The Grind</div>
      </div>

      <h2>
        Some days are just <span>work.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="lead">
        A lot of what I am trying to build doesn't happen in one exciting moment.
      </p>

      <p class="body">
        It happens through sitting down again.
        Trying again.
        Reading something I didn't understand.
        Fixing something that broke.
        Starting something that looked too difficult.
        And doing another small piece even when nobody is watching.
      </p>

      <div class="stamp">
        Still working
      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================================
         PAGE 03
    ========================================== -->

    <section class="page">

      <div class="page-top">
        <div class="page-number">03</div>
        <div class="page-type">The Hard Part</div>
      </div>

      <h2>
        I get <span>tired.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="lead">
        Trying hard does not mean I never get exhausted.
      </p>

      <p class="body">
        There are days when my brain feels full,
        when I have done enough for the day,
        and when the things I wanted to finish
        simply have to wait.
        I am learning that being tired doesn't automatically mean
        I am failing.
        Sometimes it simply means I have been carrying a lot.
      </p>

      <div class="quote">
        Rest is not the opposite of progress.
        Sometimes it is part of it.
      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================================
         PAGE 04
    ========================================== -->

    <section class="page">

      <div class="page-top">
        <div class="page-number">04</div>
        <div class="page-type">Learning</div>
      </div>

      <h2>
        I keep <span>learning.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="lead">
        I like the feeling of finally understanding something
        that confused me yesterday.
      </p>

      <p class="body">
        I don't want to only know the answer.
        I want to understand why the answer works.
        That is one of the reasons I keep coming back
        when something doesn't make sense the first time.
      </p>

      <div class="meter-block">

        <div class="meter-row">
          <div class="meter-label">
            <span>Curiosity</span>
            <span>always on</span>
          </div>

          <div class="meter">
            <span style="width:94%"></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="meter-row">
          <div class="meter-label">
            <span>Patience</span>
            <span>still improving</span>
          </div>

          <div class="meter">
            <span style="width:66%"></span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================================
         PAGE 05
    ========================================== -->

    <section class="page">

      <div class="page-top">
        <div class="page-number">05</div>
        <div class="page-type">Good & Bad</div>
      </div>

      <h2>
        I know I am not <span>perfect.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="lead">
        There are things I am proud of and things I still need to fix.
      </p>

      <p class="body">
        Sometimes I overthink.
        Sometimes I push myself too hard.
        Sometimes I expect too much from myself.
        Sometimes I get things wrong.
        But I don't want to pretend those things don't exist.
        I would rather notice them and slowly become better at handling them.
      </p>

      <div class="columns">

        <div class="info">
          <div class="info-label">
            What I like about myself
          </div>

          <div class="info-value">
            I keep trying.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="info">
          <div class="info-label">
            What I am still working on
          </div>

          <div class="info-value">
            Becoming calmer with myself.
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================================
         PAGE 06
    ========================================== -->

    <section class="page">

      <div class="page-top">
        <div class="page-number">06</div>
        <div class="page-type">Routine</div>
      </div>

      <h2>
        An ordinary day can still be <span>important.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="body">
        My days aren't always dramatic.
        A lot of them are made from ordinary things:
        getting through the day, studying, working on something,
        learning, taking breaks, talking to people I care about,
        and eventually trying to sleep with another hundred thoughts
        still somewhere in my head.
      </p>

      <div class="timeline">

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="time">Morning</div>
          <div class="activity">
            Start the day, handle what needs to be handled,
            and get moving.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="time">Day</div>
          <div class="activity">
            College, responsibilities, learning,
            and whatever else the day decides to throw at me.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="time">Evening</div>
          <div class="activity">
            Rest, work on things I care about,
            talk, think, learn, or simply breathe for a while.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="time">Night</div>
          <div class="activity">
            More thoughts.
            More plans.
            Sometimes more work.
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================================
         PAGE 07
    ========================================== -->

    <section class="page">

      <div class="page-top">
        <div class="page-number">07</div>
        <div class="page-type">Pressure</div>
      </div>

      <h2>
        Sometimes I feel like I should be <span>faster.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="lead">
        That is probably one of the hardest things about ambition.
      </p>

      <p class="body">
        When you can imagine the person you want to become,
        the distance between today and that version of you
        can feel frustratingly large.
        I sometimes want everything to happen immediately.
        Then reality reminds me that building a life takes time.
      </p>

      <div class="quote">
        I don't need to become everything today.
        I just need to keep becoming.
      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================================
         PAGE 08
    ========================================== -->

    <section class="page">

      <div class="page-top">
        <div class="page-number">08</div>
        <div class="page-type">Dreams</div>
      </div>

      <h2>
        I have <span>big dreams.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="lead">
        And sometimes they feel much bigger than me.
      </p>

      <p class="body">
        I want to build something of my own.
        I want to become genuinely good at what I do.
        I want the work I create to mean something.
        I want to be able to look back one day and know
        that all those small attempts were leading somewhere.
      </p>

      <div class="stamp">
        Dream not cancelled
      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================================
         PAGE 09
    ========================================== -->

    <section class="page">

      <div class="page-top">
        <div class="page-number">09</div>
        <div class="page-type">Fear</div>
      </div>

      <h2>
        Sometimes I wonder, <span>what if I fail?</span>
      </h2>

